  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Becoming more…: adjective + ra / lên / đi / lại",
     "texto": [
      "After an adjective, these words no longer indicate a place: they say that something **has changed**. There's a logic:",
      "**ra** and **lên** = the change goes **up or for the better**: **béo ra** (to put on weight), **đẹp ra / đẹp lên** (to look more beautiful), **trẻ ra** (to look younger), **khỏe ra / khỏe lên**, **tăng lên** (to rise, to increase), **sáng ra** (to brighten up).",
      "**đi** = the change goes **down or for the worse**: **gầy đi** (to lose weight), **xấu đi** (to get worse), **yếu đi** (to become weaker), **già đi** (to get older), **giảm đi** (to fall, to decrease).",
      "**lại** = shrinking, slowing down: **nhỏ lại** (to get smaller), **chậm lại** (to slow down), **ngắn lại** (to shorten).",
      "Tip: the good things «come out» or «go up»; the bad things «go away»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
